{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/921711-american-charm","id":921711,"title":"American Charm?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-26T15:09:33-07:00","id":921711,"title":"American Charm?","content":"I was flipping though some of my old books the other day and I came across the phrase American Charm, as in &quot;Your American Charm won't work on me.&quot; That got me thinking, I have no idea what that phrase means. This may be the case that one cannot see the back of their own head without mirrors, but as much as I wrack my brain I could not tell you a unique American personality trait that others would find charming (or a uniquely American personality trait actually). So I ask you, does anyone have the first clue what this could mean? Non-American's preferably.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1882-ghost","name":"Ghost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1882_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T16:41:41-07:00","id":921748,"title":"","content":"Likely depends on the situation and era the book takes place in. But people used to like Americans for a lot of the things they claim to dislike in them. Brashness, a lack of pretense and sort of idealism or sense of honor. Look at Quincey Morris from Bram Stoker's Dracula, or Ethan Chandler from Penny Dreadful. It hearkens back to an age when America was considered exotic.<br /> <br /> If it's used in a more modern sense it might be an insult.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}